        "Keep the plan date or revision beside the equipment list, and name the person coordinating the pool work. Tell the electrician whether the proposed positions are agreed or still being discussed. If a supplier document describes an optional accessory, mark it as undecided instead of presenting it as part of the final installation. Missing documents can remain a question for the supplier; do not inspect concealed parts or enter equipment enclosures to fill the gap.",
