        "Use existing correspondence to identify the electricity retailer and ask what needs to be arranged for each premises. Energy Made Easy's moving guide supports that contact and responsibility distinction. Its article is dated October 2023, so suggested connection timing in it is not a current service promise here. The retailer needs to confirm the actual arrangements rather than an electrician assuming an old plan or account automatically follows you.",
