    firstFaq: { question: "Will an East Hills electrician booking transfer my electricity account?", answer: "No. Contact the retailer about the old premises and destination using the correct address details and existing correspondence. Keep its confirmations distinct from any appointment for repairs or alterations. An electrical quotation does not close an account, open a new one or guarantee that supply will be energised when you arrive." },
    finalFaq: { question: "What should I tell an electrician about a repair during a move?", answer: "Identify the premises, the observed concern or proposed change, and who can authorise access. Mention an unresolved supply arrangement as background without forwarding bills or credentials. Agree the private work separately and retain any resulting findings. Do not access meters or test the installation yourself to turn an uncertain moving date into a confirmed electrical outcome." },
